abstract: >
  A streaming variant of Learned Bloom Filters that maintains bounded
  false-positive rate over unbounded insertions via a hybrid drift-triggered
  retraining mechanism and a Scalable Bloom Filter backup. Includes a
  research-grade benchmark harness comparing classic, static learned,
  and streaming LBF variants on daily URLhaus snapshots.
